    "HostBrowserLiveControlParams": {
      "description": "Params of `host/browser/liveControl` (core → host): a live-view control that is not page input. The page input itself goes as `host/browser/command{action:\"input\"}`. The result is null; a failure is a JSON-RPC error.",
